MIKE BRANCH: I think
one of the things,

00:00:01.625 --> 00:00:04.870
if I were to rewind five years
and play things over again--

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.190
and it seems very, very simple.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:06.690
It does.

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:08.850
It's very intuitive,
but I think this one

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.956
thing would go a long way for
anybody starting their journey.

00:00:11.956 --> 00:00:15.924
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:21.257 --> 00:00:22.340
BRUNO AZIZA: Hi, everyone.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.250
I'm Bruno Aziza, and welcome
to another great episode

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.330
