This is a place that we come
to learn from leaders in data

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:32.720
and analytics, leaders who
have achieved amazing results

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.850
and growth,
significant outcomes,

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:37.790
